cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  For the latest tagged release, cite the version and its release DOI when
  available. For an artifact on main that is not included in a tagged release,
  cite the specific commit and artifact path.
title: "Research Artifact Ledger"
authors:
  - family-names: Davis
    given-names: Richard George
date-released: 2026-10-08
version: 0.2.0
url: https://github.com/RichardGeorgeDavis/research-artifact-ledger
abstract: >-
  A versioned repository for bounded research artifacts with explicit source
  trails, evidence labels, reproduction notes, limitations, and correction
  history. Version 0.2.0 contains a reproduced finite negative prime-ranking
  screen; it makes no general predictor or novelty claim. Current main also
  contains untagged public records: a descriptive BFT first-event comparison;
  Gaussian-moat formal endpoint and bounded source-audit records; a conditional
  helix-metric application; a bounded prime-blind logarithmic-height derivation;
  a philosophical working paper with synthetic demonstrations and unresolved
  evidential questions; an exploratory numerical-cognition note; a bounded
  neutral-scalar wormhole source review; and a bounded source review of
  matched-CMB-circle limits on global topology. These records do not claim peer
  review, broad verification, field-level novelty, or new empirical or physical
  results. Cite a commit when citing untagged content on main.
